SUMMARY:Life Visioning Practice
DESCRIPTION:Visioning is the spiritual practice of tuning in to the Self within to receive guidance about our lives. The Life Visioning Practice group meets weekly on Zoom to support one another in visioning. In it\, you will be guided by one of our experienced Practitioners through the visioning process. If you would like to learn more and experience the benefits of visioning in your life\, this group is for you. \nJoin weekly on Mondays from Noon to 1 pm Pacific time on Zoom. Be sure to bring a journal to record your visioning results. \nClick here too join the Zoom. \n 
URL:https://cslsr.org/event/life-visioning-practice-2/2026-09-07/
LOCATION:Center for Spiritual Living\, CA
CATEGORIES:Groups,Life Visioning Practice,Meditation
